{"data":{"body":"[P2] Assert that a non-finite deadline does not create a timer\n\nThis assertion does not protect the new `Number.isFinite` guard. `getRemainingTimeMs()` converts this fixture's `NaN` to `Infinity`; removing the guard would repeatedly schedule overflow timeouts because `Infinity > 0`, while the handler could still return the asserted `SUCCEEDED` response. The test misses the resulting 1 ms timer/warning loop. Assert that no deadline timer is scheduled, so removing the guard fails the test as required by CONTRIBUTING rule 4.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs8AAAABDVnKxg","finding_digest":"45895f7355cc1c7bbcd7cb1221e9bb47f82a27adbddd8bcb4539ea441b09d34d","finding_id":"arf_v1_iwev642vzqohxpgxzmjcd2n3i7","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/with-durable-execution.deadline.composed.test.ts::no-finite-remaining-time::no-deadline-timer-coverage","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/with-durable-execution.deadline.composed.test.ts::no-finite-remaining-time::no-deadline-timer-coverage","line":169,"observation_digest":"77567b942198f9860f19d1f55baf7d4c45d8515e31c2d040a2d048f1d82673aa","observation_id":"aro_v1_o5lhxfbbtd4ymdyz2h2vxl35jr","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/with-durable-execution.deadline.composed.test.ts","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-11-09T22:53:46Z","review_id":"arr_v1_zzouvzajtbe56majgwid2bzj7t","reviewed_base_sha":"d80f532428c15b451052841e5e6848d8f821d351","reviewed_head_sha":"d6c8d6965ca27f64379ba7b8a34139baf06977e4","reviewer":"codex","start_line":166,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":1202},"record_id":"art_v1_fwkhcldfmni3qqezxevnij4xdv","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-11-09T22:53:46Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
